    "sections": {
        "description": "Restaurant Cafe Theme is a website theme designed for food service businesses and dining establishments. It includes pre-built layouts for home, menu, about, gallery, and contact pages. The menu section supports categorized listings with pricing and item descriptions. The reservation feature allows integration with booking forms or third-party scheduling tools. The design is responsive and adapts to different screen sizes, including mobile and tablet devices. It provides customization options for colors, typography, and layout structure. The theme includes support for image galleries to display food items and interior spaces. A blog section is available for publishing updates, recipes, or announcements. Contact sections include forms and map integration for location display. The code structure is optimized for performance and compatibility with modern browsers. It also supports basic SEO structure and accessibility standards. The layout is modular, allowing sections to be enabled or disabled as required without external dependencies required generally."
    },
